er asks for a summary of a shared Google Doc.\"\n**After (steps):** Drop the \"handles the summary request and\" clause. The `then` now names only the observable action (\"displays a summary…\"), which the `given`/`when` already set up. Given and When are unchanged.\n```yaml\n- given: \"a Google Doc with at least 500 words of body text is shared with the Claude User's account\"\n- when: \"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\"\n- then: \"Claude displays a summary of 150 words or fewer in the conversation\"\n```\n\nNo new ACs are needed — the check is a verb-vocabulary fix only.\n\n## Complete Fixed Acceptance Criteria\n\n```yaml\n- ac_id: AC-1\n  description: \"Claude must display a summary of 150 words or fewer in the conversation when the Claude User asks for a summary of a shared Google Doc.\"\n  steps:\n    - given: \"a Google Doc with at least 500 words of body text is shared with the Claude User's account\"\n    - when: \"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\"\n    - then: \"Claude displays a summary of 150 words or fewer in the conversation\"\n\n- ac_id: AC-2\n  description: \"Claude must display the message 'This document is not shared with your account' when the Claude User asks for a summary of a document they cannot access.\"\n  steps:\n    - given: \"a Google Doc exists that is not shared with the Claude User's account\"\n    - when: \"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize that document\"\n    - then: \"Claude displays the message 'This document is not shared with your account'\"\n    - then: \"Claude does not display any content from the document\"\n\n- ac_id: AC-3\n  description: \"Claude must display the message 'The summary timed out - please try again' when no summary is produced within 30 seconds.\"\n  steps:\n    - given: \"a Google Doc is shared with the Claude User's account\"\n    - given: \"the summary backend does not respond within 30 seconds\"\n    - when: \"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the d